AI QUANT 4.0 - Example environment

PAPER TRADING ONLY — No real exchange orders.

Application

HOST=0.0.0.0
PORT=7860
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
DB_PATH=/data/ai_quant.db

Market configuration

SYMBOLS=BTC-USDT,ETH-USDT,BNB-USDT,SOL-USDT,XRP-USDT
TIMEFRAMES=15m,1h,4h
KLINE_LIMIT=300
SCAN_INTERVAL_SECONDS=180
HTTP_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=15

Paper portfolio

STARTING_BALANCE=200
MAX_OPEN_POSITIONS=3
MIN_SCORE_TO_ENTER=75

Portfolio risk limits

PORTFOLIO_RISK_FRACTION=0.10
PORTFOLIO_EXPOSURE_LIMIT=0.10

Simulation costs

FEE_RATE=0.001
SLIPPAGE_BPS=5
STOP_ATR_MULTIPLIER=2
TARGET_R_MULTIPLIER=2

Hugging Face AI Council (optional)

HF_TOKEN=
HF_API_URL=https://router.huggingface.co/v1/chat/completions
HF_MODELS=
AI_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=20
AI_MIN_MODELS=2
AI_MIN_AGREEMENT=0.60

Telegram notifications (optional)

TELEGRAM_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_ADMIN_ID=

News

NEWS_REFRESH_SECONDS=600

Dashboard

API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:7860
DASHBOARD_HTTP_TIMEOUT=8

CORS

CORS_ORIGINS=
